  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your hard head is both weapon and shield for you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Hard-Headed<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When wearing a helmet, you gain a +1 shield bonus to AC. Even if helmetless, you can attack with a head-butt as if it were a shield bash attack, treating your head as a light shield if you are bare-headed or as a heavy shield if you are wearing a helmet; your head is always considered a light weapon. If you expend one use of mythic power, you can treat your helmet as if it had the bashing shield property for making shield bash attacks and gain the benefits of Bull Rush Strike<sup>APG</sup> on any critical hit you confirm with your head for a number of rounds equal to your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc164\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
